# This fixture ships its own throwaway git history via setup-fixture-git.ps1
# / setup-fixture-git.sh. Those scripts copy this tree to a --target/-Target
# directory (normally under the OS temp dir) and seed git history THERE —
# they must never be pointed at this checked-in tree directly.
#
# This entry is defensive only: if a nested repo is ever initialized here by
# mistake, its .git/ must never be staged into the parent docspine repo.
.git/
node_modules/